text Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_ManyMonsOnlyInForests {
    "Many Pokémon live only in forests \n"
    "and caves.\p"
    "You need to be persistent and look\n"
    "everywhere to get different kinds.$"
}

text Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_CanCutSkinnyTrees {
    "Have you noticed the skinny trees\n"
    "on the roadside?\p"
    "They can be cut down by a special\n"
    "Pokémon move, I hear.$"
}

text Route2_ViridianForest_NorthEntrance_Text_CanCancelEvolution {
    "Do you know the evolution-cancel\n"
    "technique?\p"
    "When a Pokémon is evolving, you\n"
    "can stop the process.\p"
    "It's a technique for raising\n"
    "Pokémon the way they are.$"
}
